modes:
  - file: annotated_dailies_export
    load: immediate

description: |
  <p>Exports every annotated clip in the current playlist as its own movie with
  the annotations burned in, plus a still of each annotated frame - or just the
  annotated frames. Clips without annotations are skipped. Uses rvio on a
  temporary copy of the session.</p>
  <p>Menu: Annotated Dailies &gt; Export Annotated Clips... / Export Annotated Frames Only...</p>
  <p>Set RVIO_PATH if rvio is not next to rv or on your PATH.</p>
